# send=0: 0xd3 DRAM pointer + 0xd2 size + 0xd0/0xd1/0xd5 hash), which is what
# starts the open SC.  arch/arm/mach-meson/spl-gxl-scp.c is #if'd on this, so
# without it the loader compiles to nothing and the SPL carries no "SCP: "
# string at all.  SPL phase only -- TPL never runs it.
